" data-source=\"senseinvis\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sense Invis</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Behavioural Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walksaround\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Around</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Energy Field (Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Field_Square_8987b7.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Energy<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walksthrough\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Through</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Fire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_0ff2ec.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Fire</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20180206145436&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Elf_Overseer_0f73fc.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an elf overseer.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Do you want some more water, yes? YES?</li><li>DOWN WITH THE FIRES OF IGNORANCE!!</li><li>Don't you dare attack the followers of the bog!</li><li>You stay in there!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Was introduced in the Summer Update 2011. Three of them will <a href=\"#/wiki/Respawn\">respawn</a> daily in three different places, and all need to be killed in order to allow the <a href=\"#/wiki/Firestarter\">Firestarters</a> to be free and set <a href=\"#/wiki/Shadowthorn\">Shadowthorn</a> on fire during the <a href=\"#/quest/thornfire-world-change\">Thornfire World Change</a>. When Shadowthorn is burning, they will not respawn.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-75?)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Healing\"><img alt=\"Healing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> Self-Healing</span> (50-72?)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Missing Element\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"13\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Question_Mark_Icon_e8125e.png\" width=\"8\"/></span></span> Bubble Beam</span> (89+?)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Drown Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_dcd703.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Drown Explosion</span> (50+)</div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Physical_Icon_Big_83da43.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:95.2381%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 4.7619%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-v